graph TB
    Student["👤 Student<br/>Main user who manages<br/>personal task list and<br/>syncs with MyCourses"]
    
    Instructor["👤 Instructor<br/>Views teaching-related tasks<br/>and monitors assignment<br/>deadlines"]
    
    Admin["👤 System Administrator<br/>Manages configuration,<br/>user accounts, and<br/>monitors sync health"]
    
    TodoSystem["<b>ICT To Do List</b><br/>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━<br/>Task management system<br/>supporting Web and Mobile<br/>applications for tracking<br/>personal tasks and syncing<br/>course assignments"]
    
    MyCourses["📚 MyCourses<br/>External e-learning system<br/>that owns course, assignment,<br/>and submission data"]
    
    Student -->|Uses| TodoSystem
    Instructor -->|Uses| TodoSystem
    Admin -->|Uses| TodoSystem
    
    TodoSystem -->|Syncs courses, assignments,<br/>and submission status<br/>via REST/JSON over HTTPS| MyCourses
    
    MyCourses -->|Returns assignment and<br/>submission data| TodoSystem
    
    classDef system fill:#1168bd,stroke:#000,stroke-width:3px,color:#fff,font-size:14px
    classDef user fill:#08427b,stroke:#000,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff,font-size:12px
    classDef external fill:#999,stroke:#000,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff,font-size:12px
    
    class TodoSystem system
    class Student,Instructor,Admin user
    class MyCourses external
